0 // Non-official geometry; user-authorized local approximation 2026-10-13, not measured physical fit.
0 // LDraw official/unofficial and fixed mirror returned 404 on 2026-10-13.
0 // Reference: courseware 4-da-xiang p4/p5/p12; catalog-confirmed ID, not a 45002 inventory part.
0 // Local axes in mounted pose: X span, Y vertical, +Z outward; mounting plane Z=0, beam studs +Z.
0 // Two swept curved wing shells and oval end plates; span 398 LDU, end-plate chord 160 LDU.
0 // The central beam reuses 76057.dat local approximation as integral geometry; studs/bores/threads remain approximate.
0 // Shell curvature, ribs and tip thickness inferred from p4 and catalog photo; no ordinary plate stand-in.
0 // Two placements only in elephant step 4; mirror pose uses a proper 180-degree Y rotation.
0 BFC CERTIFY CCW
